{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/RotatedShape\/layoutDirectionBehavior","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/rotatedshape\/layoutdirectionbehavior"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"layoutDirectionBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LayoutDirectionBehavior","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI23LayoutDirectionBehaviorO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LayoutDirectionBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the layoutDirectionBehavior for a Shape is one that mirrors, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shape’s path will be mirrored horizontally when in the specified layout"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"direction. When mirrored, the individual points of the path will be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transformed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Defaults to "},{"code":".mirrors","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when deploying on iOS 17.0, macOS 14.0,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tvOS 17.0, watchOS 10.0 and later, and to "},{"code":".fixed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To mirror a path when deploying to earlier releases, either use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"View.flipsForRightToLeftLayoutDirection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a filled or stroked"},{"type":"tex